Package: finalproject
Title: Missing Mental Health Data in NHANES and Waterborne Outbreak Size
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Yi",
           family = "Wang",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "yiwang1@hsph.harvard.edu",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0009-2274-0783"))
Description: Examines demographic patterns in missing mental health responses
    in NHANES and changes in sample composition after excluding incomplete
    records. Compares reported waterborne outbreak sizes across drinking
    water and recreational water exposure types using CDC data.
    Provides reproducible analyses, descriptive summaries, and visualizations
    through R package vignettes and a pkgdown website.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests: knitr, testthat, rmarkdown, pkgdown
License: Artistic-2.0
VignetteBuilder: quarto
Encoding: UTF-8
